@RetireEarlyBird You’re missing the bigger picture. Carbon fiber’s complexity is precisely what could create a massive competitive moat for $RKLB.

Steel is cheaper and easier to manufacture, but carbon composites offer superior strength-to-weight efficiency, which can translate into greater payload capacity and better launch economics.

